  ],
  "evidence_quotes": [
    "In reading Tillich I know now, know at last. that this is God (the first vision of this was, indeed, by Jakob Boehme). It - the dialectic - is between the prerational will in God the Aotos or reason in God; the latter always wing + at the end of each sequence.",
    "The book \"Valis 4 is, then, a world-drama in which the dialectic that makes up the esse of God Acts its dynamic logic out, the dialectic that Boehme saw + I saw.",
